  m_Name: Magnet
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Balltallion.Simulation.Abilities.EquipableDataSO
  designerNotes: 'Cristian: Magnetism / other physical forces (gravity, rope, etc...) might be very interesting to play around with.


    I prototyped this using by using the OnTimer trigger to spam knockback towards the opponent, simulating a continuous force applied at all times.


    I think it would be beneficial for melee balls to get closer to their opponent. Might be too OP though?


    If we like this, I can maybe create an "ApplyConstantForce" effect instead of doing the weird knockback timer.'
  displayName: Magnet
  tooltipDescription: Magnetically attracts your ball to the opponent!
  icon: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 51faa7b154844f04b833805d75d432b3, type: 3}
